\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Tursunay Ziyawudun was (is) one of the victims. She was arrested in April 2017 for the first time. She had committed no crime, only wearing her veil and being seen as a woman who fulfilled religious mandates. She was taken to Xinyuan County Vocational School in }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 Xinjiang}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 . "Vocational" is the euphemism that the regime uses to soften the trueidentity of their detention camps. She was in jail for a month. But a year later, she was again taken hostage.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0
\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Ziyawudun was in a cell with 20 other }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 women}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 . During the day I received some food and water. To the bathroom, he recounted, he could go for up to five minutes a day. If it went too far in time inside the toilet, it could suffer consequences: "Those who spent the most time received electric shocks with canes," he said.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2
\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The interrogations, strange to be an alleged vocational school, were endless. The guards wanted to know why she remained with her husband Halmirza Halik in Kazakhstan for five years before returning to China in 2017. They were doing it to the punches. But in one of those sessions hell was complete: Ziyawudun claimed that two female guards took her to another room where she was placed on a table. "They inserted a paralyzing cane inside me and twisted me and electrocuted me with it. I fainted."}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2
\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Ten days later, the worst came back. She was taken out of her cell and taken somewhere else. "In the next room I heard another girl crying and screaming. I saw about five or six men entering that room. I thought she was being tortured. But then I was raped as a group. After that I realized what they had done to her, too. They were extremely sadistic, causing pain and damage to the body by hitting me and hitting my head against the wall... was his way of punishing us," said the victim who now lives in America.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2
\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 He arrived in America after a long journey. She was released and September 2019 was warned by the regime: she could not talk to anyone about what she had experienced in that "vocational" center. She then began the way of the reunion with her husband, who was waiting for her on the border with Kazakhstan. But there, in the following days and as a result of the multiple rapes, he had severe vaginal bleeding. Once on the other side of the border, she was taken by plane to the United States, where she managed to survive.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2
